@startuml diagram
!include ../../theme.iuml

title Blog: agregát Post a feature slices

package "Blog Bounded Context" as Blog {

  package "Domain" as Domain {
    rectangle "**Post**\n<size:12>agregátní kořen</size>" as Post
    note right of Post
      create(PostId, title, content, AuthorId): self
      addComment(CommentId, AuthorId, text): void
      closeComments(): void
      updateTitle(string): void
      updateContent(string): void
    end note

    rectangle "Comment\n<size:12>entita uvnitř agregátu</size>" as Comment
    rectangle "PostCreated\nCommentAdded\n<size:12>doménové události</size>" as Events #1B202A
    rectangle "CommentsClosedException" as Ex
    rectangle "PostRepository\n<size:12>rozhraní</size>" as Repo
  }

  package "Infrastructure" as Infra {
    rectangle "DoctrinePostRepository" as DoctrineRepo
  }

  package "Feature slices" as Slices {
    rectangle "CreatePost\n<size:11>Command + Controller</size>" as S1
    rectangle "AddComment\n<size:11>Command + Controller</size>" as S2
    rectangle "GetPost\n<size:11>Query + Controller + ViewModel</size>" as S3
    rectangle "GetPosts\n<size:11>Query + Controller + ViewModel</size>" as S4
  }
}

Post "1" *-- "0..*" Comment
Post ..> Events : nahraje ve factory\na v doménových metodách
Post ..> Ex : addComment() po closeComments()

Repo <|.. DoctrineRepo

S1 ..> Repo
S2 ..> Repo
S3 ..> Repo
S4 ..> Repo

note bottom of Slices
  Řez podle případu užití, ne podle vrstvy.
  Každý slice drží svůj command nebo query
  pohromadě s controllerem.
end note

@enduml
